Model Playground local hardened variant

This package is a modified fork of hex-ci/cpa-plugin-model-playground:
https://github.com/hex-ci/cpa-plugin-model-playground
Upstream revision: 72469d5fd0d01cff6682de092cd76f1252f34898
The upstream MIT license and copyright notice are preserved in LICENSE.

Local modifications: Arabic minimal model chooser and streaming chat interface;
manual client API key stored only in page memory; plain text response rendering;
removed management-session and API-key discovery, arbitrary-origin server proxy,
browser persistence, and Markdown renderer; migrated SDK dependency to CLIProxyAPI
v8.0.41. No bundled marked code is used or included in the source release.

CLIProxyAPI SDK v8.0.41:
https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI
License: MIT. SDK code is linked into the compiled plugin through Go modules.
